# The build context of the Dockerfile (WP9c, ADR-0026): only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md,
# LICENSE, src/, configs/ and scripts/fetch_psplib.py are copied; everything else stays out, and
# secrets and data never enter the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!configs/
!scripts/fetch_psplib.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
